// ---- U004 The shoes (U004-the-shoes.md)
#opening[In 1956 Ruth went][down to Minneapolis for three years of nursing school.]#idx("Minneapolis, Minnesota", "nursing school") The
students lived in a dormitory, and the house mother inspected their shoes every morning.
"Every morning! As if the patients were going to look at our shoes."
